{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/about_en_02.png?t=1745346723\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/image_08_en_02.png?t=1745346723\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main character is an unfulfilled chef who can cook anything. One day, his life turns upside down when his food begins to turn into different girls, evening after evening.<br><br>A cute and cozy game about cooking and dating.\u00a0Cook different food in interesting games, and then spend unforgettable evenings with different consequences with cute girls.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/image_06_en_03.png?t=1745346723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A cozy and beautiful game. We tried very hard to create a comfortable and relaxing atmosphere through a unique visual style, pleasant music and moderate difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/Chars_en_02.png?t=1745346723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/image_01_en_03.png?t=1745346723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters for all tastes. All the girls have their own unique personalities that match the food they embody. Each has her own backstory, thoughts and concerns.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/anim_st_en_700_01.gif?t=1745346723\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A young worker in her family's store. Maybe this is not an ordinary store, and maybe she is not an ordinary girl. Get to know her better in a big romance story. Perhaps she will be the one who can give you happiness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/IMG_0994.png?t=1745346723\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Warm and caring in the daytime, hot at night. Saves her delicious juiciness for &quot;that one&quot;. She does not tolerate careless treatment, but is ready to give herself completely to someone who has put his soul into her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/IMG_0992.png?t=1745346723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A headstrong and proud girl. It won't be easy to reach her feminine nature, but it's worth it. Cold but elegant, just as sushi should be. Familiar with a bright life, but maybe she wants something else?\u200b\u200b\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/image_02_en_03.png?t=1745346723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More interesting and unique characters are coming. We can't wait to get them into the game and show it to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/Features_en_02.png?t=1745346723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/image_04_en_03.png?t=1745346723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The girls are voiced on all dates.\u00a0Authentic voice acting with russian girls. Spend a good time with their gentle voices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520180/extras/image_05_en_03.png?t=1745346723\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different endings and\u00a0unique scenes f